  first | exact @GlobalTheory.dense_span_tensor_of_dense_subspaces | exact GlobalTheory.dense_span_tensor_of_dense_subspaces | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.dense_span_tensor_of_dense_subspaces <;> assumption)
